          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202406/bg2024060801.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>一个网页应用，将图片转成彩色的 ASCII 字符图（上图）。</p>",
